# NOTICE

Copied unmodified from `https://github.com/MediaComem/FGDM4GS`
(WP2-WP3 work package, "Flat Geodata Models for Geoservices"), path
`WP2-WP3/model/<ModelDir>/<file>`:

- `Axis_V1_1_d.ili` (from `Axis_V1_1/`)
- `IVS_V3_d.ili`, `IVS_V3.ili` (from `IVS_V2_1/`)
- `Planungszonen_V2_d_A.ili`, `Planungszonen_V2_d_B.ili`, `Planungszonen_V2.ili`
  (from `Planungszonen_V1_1/`)
- `SectoralPlanForRoadInfrastructure_V1_4_d.ili` (from
  `SectoralPlanForRoadInfrastructure_V1_4/`)

These are the "_d" (data) derived models from the FGDM4GS project
(HEIG-VD, `Rapport-FGDM4GS_v1-final.pdf`) - each `IMPORTS` a real Swiss
federal MGDM and defines one `VIEW` (`PROJECTION OF`/`JOIN OF ... WHERE`)
that flattens it for geoservice publication, per the report's own
methodology (chapter 4). The companion "_gm" (graphic model) files in the
same repo are deliberately NOT vendored here - they add `StandardSymbology`
`GRAPHIC` definitions for cartographic representation, a separate concern
(backlog item 6, `.claude/PROGRESS.md`), not needed to exercise the VIEW
mapping itself.

The repo has no declared license (`license: null` via the GitHub API,
checked 2026-08-24). The report and this repo share an author
(`test@example.org`) with this project's own user - vendored
here as real, author-confirmed corpus material for testing VIEW
construction, not redistributed for any other purpose.

**Real corpus finding these fixtures exist to preserve** (2026-08-24):
all 5 "_d" files exclusively use the `Name := expression` view attribute
redefinition form (`viewAttributes`'s `bare_redefinition_list`/
`modifier_reassignment` alternative) - NONE use `ALL OF`. This form was
previously `status: unresolved` in `InterlisModelBuilder` with "no real
corpus evidence" noted (backlog item 8 Lot A2) - these 5 files are that
evidence. Confirmed empirically: `View.RenamedBaseView`/`FormationKind`/
`Where` build correctly for all 5, but `View.ClassAttribute` stays EMPTY
(`0` for every file) - a real, high-value gap, see `.claude/PROGRESS.md`.

**To build these against their full IMPORTS closure**, a repo directory
also containing the base MGDMs they import is needed: `Axis_LV95_V1_1`
(`Axis_V1_1_d.ili`) and `BaseModel_SectoralPlans_LV95_V1_4`/
`BaseModel_SectoralPlans_Catalogues_V1_4`
(`SectoralPlanForRoadInfrastructure_V1_4_d.ili`) are both already present
in the real `ili_corpus/` scratch corpus (gitignored, re-fetched per
session - see `docs/model-resolution-strategy.md`) under their existing
files; `IVS_V3`/`Planungszonen_V2` are vendored directly alongside their
derived models here (the official `models.geo.admin.ch` catalog only has
the OLDER `IVS_V2_1`/`Planungszonen_V1_1` as of 2026-08-24 - the newer
versions these derived models target aren't published there yet, only in
the FGDM4GS repo itself).
